00:12:02.644 --> 00:12:04.304
- [Voiceover] How long is too long for

00:12:04.304 --> 00:12:06.429
a fiscally responsible entrepreneur

00:12:06.429 --> 00:12:09.865
to stay in a safe, full time job?

00:12:09.865 --> 00:12:11.862
At what point do you have to accept

00:12:11.862 --> 00:12:14.043
that it's not going to happen?

00:12:14.043 --> 00:12:17.584
Is it ever too late to start?

00:12:17.584 --> 00:12:21.021
- This question on the
show created a firestorm

00:12:21.021 --> 00:12:23.563
