00:12:34.824 --> 00:12:36.007
If you, right now,

00:12:36.007 --> 00:12:37.645
as you're running through the airport,

00:12:37.645 --> 00:12:40.061
or driving on the highway,
are going to a job,

00:12:40.061 --> 00:12:42.266
you, my friend, are not an entrepreneur.

00:12:42.266 --> 00:12:45.423
You may have entrepreneurial tendencies,

00:12:45.423 --> 00:12:46.979
but you are not an entrepreneur.

00:12:46.979 --> 00:12:48.546
Now, let me take a step back,

00:12:48.546 --> 00:12:50.182
deploy a little humility in the bravado

00:12:50.182 --> 00:12:54.698
that I'm about to spit.

00:12:54.698 --> 00:12:56.220
Being an entrepreneur,

00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:57.717
a purebred entrepreneur the way

00:12:57.717 --> 00:12:59.946
that I see it, this is
one man's point of view,

00:12:59.946 --> 00:13:02.266
this is the #AskGaryVee book, after all,

00:13:02.266 --> 00:13:04.683
is somebody who doesn't even have

00:13:04.683 --> 00:13:06.864
the ability to have ever had a job.

00:13:06.864 --> 00:13:09.419
The reason I was an F student,

00:13:09.419 --> 00:13:11.211
and I would like to
think most of you realize

00:13:11.211 --> 00:13:13.132
at this point, I'm no dope.

00:13:13.132 --> 00:13:14.310
I'm not a dummy.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:18.629
It was because I couldn't deploy
going through that machine,

00:13:18.629 --> 00:13:21.078
which was built to go get a job,

00:13:21.078 --> 00:13:23.686
and I wasn't honing the skills
that I knew I had to have

00:13:23.686 --> 00:13:27.289
to be who I was, and I knew
this at nine years old,

00:13:27.289 --> 00:13:30.213
at 12 years old, at 15 years old,

00:13:30.213 --> 00:13:32.467
at my junior year of high school,

00:13:32.467 --> 00:13:36.970
I'm sitting in science class
reading the Wine Spectator.

00:13:36.970 --> 00:13:40.894
I'm doing that because I'm
prepping to be a wine merchant,

00:13:40.894 --> 00:13:42.636
because I was an entrepreneur.

00:13:42.636 --> 00:13:44.007
There was nothing else.

00:13:44.007 --> 00:13:45.411
If my dad didn't have a liquor store,

00:13:45.411 --> 00:13:46.932
I would've built on the fact that I was

00:13:46.932 --> 00:13:48.835
making $3,000 a weekend

00:13:48.835 --> 00:13:50.728
selling baseball cards in the malls

00:13:50.728 --> 00:13:52.633
of New Jersey as a 15 year old.

00:13:52.633 --> 00:13:54.988
You don't think I could've
lived on 36,000 a year?

00:13:54.988 --> 00:13:57.531
From working 52 days a
year, I sure could have.

00:13:57.531 --> 00:13:58.807
And so that's who I was,

00:13:58.807 --> 00:14:00.153
there was nothing else.

00:14:00.153 --> 00:14:04.413
Now, a lot of you said
this is unfair of me,

00:14:04.413 --> 00:14:05.853
this, that, and the other thing.

00:14:05.853 --> 00:14:08.291
What I want you to know is,

00:14:08.291 --> 00:14:11.030
my definition of an entrepreneur
should not be yours.

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:12.344
You want to think you're an entrepreneur

00:14:12.344 --> 00:14:14.143
because you do what I said in Crush It!,

00:14:14.143 --> 00:14:15.431
and come home from seven PM

00:14:15.431 --> 00:14:17.243
to two in the morning
and built a business?

00:14:17.243 --> 00:14:18.566
You want to tell me about

00:14:18.566 --> 00:14:20.411
the fact that you have student loans

00:14:20.411 --> 00:14:21.851
and you have to pay them off,

00:14:21.851 --> 00:14:23.384
and that's why you have
to do it, I get it.

00:14:23.384 --> 00:14:24.963
But I would flip it on you.

00:14:24.963 --> 00:14:27.771
I think an entrepreneur
works under entrepreneurship,

00:14:27.771 --> 00:14:30.510
and then works at 7-11 from 11 PM at night

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:32.868
to six in the morning
on the graveyard shift

00:14:32.868 --> 00:14:34.969
if they have to be practical.

00:14:34.969 --> 00:14:36.906
Because you have to understand

00:14:36.906 --> 00:14:41.867
there is nothing else,
it's like telling a singer

00:14:41.867 --> 00:14:44.326
that they can't sing, they
have to sing at night.

00:14:44.326 --> 00:14:46.230
There is nothing else, you're drawn to it,

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:47.542
you can't breathe.

00:14:47.542 --> 00:14:49.469
It is your absolute oxygen,

00:14:49.469 --> 00:14:51.209
you are an entrepreneur when you are

00:14:51.209 --> 00:14:52.488
building your business at all times.

00:14:52.488 --> 00:14:54.066
And let me say another thing,

00:14:54.066 --> 00:14:56.028
this is not 1992 anymore.

00:14:56.028 --> 00:14:57.688
It is actually way more practical

00:14:57.688 --> 00:14:59.906
to be an entrepreneur than
it's ever been before.

00:14:59.906 --> 00:15:03.063
If you are 22 years old,
if you are not willing

00:15:03.063 --> 00:15:06.767
to sleep on the floor
with nine of your buddies

00:15:06.767 --> 00:15:08.787
in a studio apartment,

00:15:08.787 --> 00:15:11.027
then you are not an entrepreneur.

00:15:11.027 --> 00:15:12.268
If you want to get a job because

00:15:12.268 --> 00:15:14.126
you want a watch or you want a car,

00:15:14.126 --> 00:15:16.240
or you want to be able to take
out girls for a nice dinner,

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:17.922
then you are not an entrepreneur.

00:15:17.922 --> 00:15:20.303
An entrepreneur does entrepreneur things,

00:15:20.303 --> 00:15:22.742
and that is by definition
building a business

00:15:22.742 --> 00:15:26.060
for yourself, period, end of story.

